📌 Model Registry

A **model registry** stores different versions of models.

Example:

| Version | Status     |
| ------- | ---------- |
| v1      | Production |
| v2      | Testing    |
| v3      | Archived   |

Popular tools:

* MLflow Model Registry
* SageMaker Model Registry

